  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "Paul Rodgers",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Lately I've been hard to reach",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I've been too long on my own",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Everybody has a private world where they can be alone",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Are you calling me?",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Are you tryin' to get through?",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Are you reaching out for me?",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I'm reaching out for you",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm just so fucking depressed, I just can't seem to get out this slump",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "If I could just get over this hump, but I need something to pull me out this dump",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I took my bruises, took my lumps, fell down, then I got right back up",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I need that spark to get psyched back up in order for me to pick the mic back up",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I don't know how or why or when I ended up in this position I'm in",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I'm starting to feel distant again, so I decided just to pick this pen",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Up and try to make an attempt to vent, but I just can't admit",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Or come to grips with the fact that I may be done with rap, I need a new outlet",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And I know some shit's so hard to swallow, but I just can't sit back and wallow",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "In my own sorrow, but I know one fact: I'll be one tough act to follow",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "One tough act to follow, I'll be one tough act to follow",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Here today, gone tomorrow",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "But you'd have to walk a thousand miles",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "In my shoes, just to see",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "What it's like to be me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I'll be you, let's trade shoes",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Just to see what it'd be like to",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Feel your pain, you feel mine",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Go inside each other's minds",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Just to see what we find",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Look at shit through each other's eyes",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "But don't let 'em say you ain't beautiful, oh",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "They can all get fucked, just stay true to you, so",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Don't let 'em say you ain't beautiful, oh",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "They can all get fucked, just stay true to you, so",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I think I'm startin' to lose my sense of humor",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Everything's so tense and gloom",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I almost feel like I gotta check the temperature of the room, just as soon as",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I walk in, it's like all eyes on me, so I try to avoid any eye contact",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "'Cause if I do that, then it opens a door for conversation like I want that",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I'm not lookin' for extra attention, I just wanna be just like you",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Blend in with the rest of the room, maybe just point me to the closest restroom",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I don't need no fuckin' man servant tryna follow me around and wipe my ass",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Laugh at every single joke I crack and half of 'em ain't even funny, like, \"Ha",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Marshall, you're so funny, man, you should be a comedian, goddamn\"",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Unfortunately I am, I just hide behind the tears of a clown",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "So why don't you all sit down? Listen to the tale I'm about to tell",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Hell, we don't gotta trade our shoes and you ain't gotta walk no thousand miles",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
