    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Nobody asked for life to deal us with these bullshit hands we're dealt",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "We gotta take these cards ourselves and flip 'em, don't expect no help",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Now, I could've either just sat on my ass and pissed and moaned",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Or take this situation in which I'm placed in and get up and get my own",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I was never the type of kid to wait by the door and pack his bags",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And sat on the porch and hoped and prayed for a dad to show up who never did",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I just wanted to fit in in every single place, every school I went",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I dreamed of being that cool kid even if it meant actin' stupid",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Aunt Edna always told me, \"Keep making that face, it'll get stuck like that\"",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Meanwhile, I'm just standin' there holdin' my tongue, tryin' to talk like this",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "'Til I stuck my tongue on that frozen stop sign pole at eight years old",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I learned my lesson then, 'cause I wasn't tryin' to impress my friends no mo'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "But I already told you my whole life story, not just based on my description",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "'Cause where you see it from where you're sittin', it's probably a hundred-and-ten percent different",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I guess we would have to walk a mile in each other's shoes at least",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "What size you wear? I wear 10s, let's see if you can fit your feet",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
